feat(iter2-phase6): Sticky top bar — small title + Today jump + 4-icon row

6.1 Title `Today` reduced to 14px subdued cream lowercase; date strip
    continues below. Whole bar (title + strip + actions) is sticky with
    z-30, navy bg, 1px gold separator. Negative-x margin extends to
    viewport edges. top:60 sits below the global Header (z-40).

6.2 Today jump button: 50x24px navy pill right of the date title.
    DateStrip now forwardRef + useImperativeHandle exposes jumpToToday()
    which (a) smooth-scrolls the strip to today's chip, (b) sets
    selectedDate to today, (c) scrolls main to top. Gold border state
    when selectedDate === today.

6.3 Action sticky row below date strip — Stack + Protocol pills on
    left, Notifications bell icon on right (spacer between). Bottom
    +Add Stack button removed; moved into this row.

6.4 AddProtocolModal lists every protocol from listProtocols. Tap to
    push id into activeProtocols; existing TodayView useEffect
    re-fetches and merges daily_plan into items. Active rows disabled.
    Toast fires "Protocol added - N stacks created today".

6.5 Notifications toggle wired to new useNotificationPrefs hook
    (state.js). First tap requests Notification.permission; on grant
    enabled=true and the scheduleNotifications useEffect is gated by
    notifPrefs.enabled. Toggle-off clears scheduled timers. Bell icon
    gold filled + accent ring when on, muted cream when off.

config.js: NOTIFICATION_PREFS + AUTOPLAY_PATTERNS LS keys added (the
latter for Phase 7.3 future-calendars opt-in map).
